Hi All,

I plan to submit a rworldmap update to CRAN at midday (BST) tomorrow. The short notice is partly because the CRAN maintainers have asked me to modernise the way it deals with necessary other packages (I should have done this a while ago).

The changes shouldn't effect users negatively, but if you want to test your work on the development version that would be much appreciated.

install.packages("rworldmap", repos="http://R-Forge.R-project.org")
(then remember to restart R to ensure the new version gets used)

You can view changelog at :
https://r-forge.r-project.org/scm/viewvc.php/pkg/rworldmap/ChangeLog?view=markup&root=rworldmap

Happy mapping,
Andy

